{"id":"cloze-gen-7","familyId":"cloze-gen-7","skillIds":["cloze.context"],"level":"G1","section":"cloze","reviewMode":"recall","promptZh":"阅读短文，根据上下文在空白处填入适当的词。","resourceId":"cloze-gen-res-7","estimatedSeconds":420,"sourceIds":["tool-generated-practice"],"explanation":{"summaryZh":"一场特别的接力赛","ruleZh":"完形：先通读抓主旨，再逐空看搭配与上下文。","evidence":[{"resourceId":"cloze-gen-res-7","paragraphId":"p1","quote":"Our class entered the school relay race {} one pro"}],"distractors":[]},"kind":"gaps","inputMode":"text","sharedOptions":[],"uniqueOptions":false,"segments":[{"type":"text","text":"Our class entered the school relay race "},{"type":"gap","gapId":"g1"},{"type":"text","text":"one problem: nobody could run the last leg fast enough."},{"type":"text","text":"Then Li Hua, who had "},{"type":"gap","gapId":"g2"},{"type":"text","text":"his leg a month before, offered a plan. He could not run, "},{"type":"gap","gapId":"g3"},{"type":"text","text":"he knew the race well. He trained the four runners on how to pass the baton "},{"type":"gap","gapId":"g4"},{"type":"text","text":", because a race is often "},{"type":"gap","gapId":"g5"},{"type":"text","text":"at the exchanges rather than on speed alone."},{"type":"text","text":"On the day of the race, our first runner kept "},{"type":"gap","gapId":"g6"},{"type":"text","text":"and stayed close to the leaders. The second and third runners "},{"type":"gap","gapId":"g7"},{"type":"text","text":"their positions, and when the baton finally reached our slowest runner, he was already in second place."},{"type":"text","text":"He was slower than the boy beside him, but he held "},{"type":"gap","gapId":"g8"},{"type":"text","text":". In the end we finished second, yet the whole class cheered as "},{"type":"gap","gapId":"g9"},{"type":"text","text":"we had won. We learned that a team is strongest when everyone is given a job that "},{"type":"gap","gapId":"g10"},{"type":"text","text":"them."}],"gaps":[{"id":"g1","label":"第1空","clue":"填介词","options":[],"accepted":["with"],"explanationZh":"with one problem"},{"id":"g2","label":"第2空","clue":"填动词过去分词","options":[],"accepted":["hurt","injured"],"explanationZh":"had hurt"},{"id":"g3","label":"第3空","clue":"无提示词：连词","options":[],"accepted":["but","yet"],"explanationZh":"转折"},{"id":"g4","label":"第4空","clue":"填副词","options":[],"accepted":["smoothly"],"explanationZh":"修饰 pass"},{"id":"g5","label":"第5空","clue":"填动词过去分词（被动）","options":[],"accepted":["won","lost"],"explanationZh":"被动"},{"id":"g6","label":"第6空","clue":"填形容词","options":[],"accepted":["calm"],"explanationZh":"kept calm"},{"id":"g7","label":"第7空","clue":"填动词过去式","options":[],"accepted":["kept","held"],"explanationZh":"保持位次"},{"id":"g8","label":"第8空","clue":"填副词小品词","options":[],"accepted":["on"],"explanationZh":"hold on"},{"id":"g9","label":"第9空","clue":"无提示词：连词","options":[],"accepted":["if","though"],"explanationZh":"as if"},{"id":"g10","label":"第10空","clue":"填动词第三人称单数","options":[],"accepted":["suits","fits"],"explanationZh":"定语从句"}],"policy":{"caseSensitive":false,"allowTerminalPunctuation":true}}
